## Operation: AddRecipient

### Summary

A staff member adds a recipient to an automation.

### Input

```schema
communicationId: string required ref(juicebar.communications#Communication.id)
recipient: part(juicebar.communications#Recipient) required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationStaff`
- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The recipient, with its provider, parameters, selection type, parameter and chosen customers, is added to the automation's recipients under a new id — [mutates](aim:juicebar.communications#Record:Communication), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications.recipients#Requirements[RECDIALOG])
- The operation is refused without `communication:role`; another organisation's automation is changed all the same — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/communications/recipients/recipient-dialog/recipient-dialog.component.ts#RecipientDialogComponent.save` — as: component
- binds: `service:communication-service#addRecipient` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: UpdateRecipient

### Summary

A staff member changes a recipient of an automation.

### Input

```schema
communicationId: string required ref(juicebar.communications#Communication.id)
recipient: part(juicebar.communications#Recipient) required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationStaff`
- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The dialog shows the recipient's kept customers of the staff member's organisation — [reads](aim:juicebar.communications#Record:Communication), [invokes](aim:juicebar.communications#Capability:CustomerDirectory), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications.recipients#Requirements[RECEDIT])
- The recipient with the same id takes the provider, parameters, selection type, parameter and chosen customers given — [mutates](aim:juicebar.communications#Record:Communication), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications.recipients#Requirements[RECEDIT])
- The operation is refused without `communication:role`; another organisation's automation is changed all the same — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/communications/recipients/recipient-dialog/recipient-dialog.component.ts#RecipientDialogComponent.save` — as: component
- binds: `service:communication-service#fetchCustomerModels` — as: handler
- binds: `service:communication-service#updateRecipient` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: RemoveRecipient

### Summary

A staff member deletes a recipient of an automation.

### Input

```schema
communicationId: string required ref(juicebar.communications#Communication.id)
recipient: part(juicebar.communications#Recipient) required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationStaff`
- `juicebar.communications#Persona:CommunicationSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- Every recipient of the automation with the same provider and parameters is removed, and the answer says whether one was — [mutates](aim:juicebar.communications#Record:Communication), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications.recipients#Requirements[RECLIST])
- The operation is refused without `communication:role`; another organisation's automation is changed all the same — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.communications#Requirements[COMMORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/communications/recipients/automation-recipients/automation-recipients.component.ts#AutomationRecipientsComponent.remove` — as: component
- binds: `service:communication-service#deleteRecipient` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred
